title: "What Can Money Buy? Material Power and the Limits of Allegiance"
type: article
authors:
  - family-names: Wei
    given-names: Peichen
  - family-names: Chen
    given-names: Junjie
date-released: 2026-07-30
abstract: >-
  A text-as-data study of whether U.S. foreign aid changes expressed allegiance in
  UN General Debate speeches, using restored speech text, a validated five-point
  semantic stance measure, and panel fixed-effect designs.
keywords:
  - foreign aid
  - UN Security Council
  - UN General Debate
  - text as data
  - large language models
  - instrumental variables
